---
id: F-001
title: Reflected XSS in search
scope: [S-14]
severity: medium
retest: pending
---

## Description

The `q` parameter is reflected unescaped.

## Remediation

Encode output.

## Proof of concept

`/search?q=<script>alert(1)</script>`

## References

- OWASP XSS Prevention Cheat Sheet
